  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">For the UNITLIFE Multi-Partner Trust Fund Office, women are agents of change in addressing one of the world&#x2019;s lesser known and underfunded diseases- chronic childhood malnutrition. UNITLIFE supports programmes that improve childhood malnutrition treatment availability and delivery, as well as expanding women&#x2019;s access to productive resources and livelihood opportunities.</narrative>
  </description>
